      "text": "[7:32PM] #Mushin #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in Mushin is moving smoothly on several routes, including Moshalasi to Ojuwoye Post Office, Ilupeju bypass to Olupese, and the return journey from Bolade to Moshalasi. \nHowever, there's a slow but steady movement under the Oshodi bridge towards Brown Junction.\nOfficers are on ground managing traffic, and no impediments have been reported, keeping everything under control. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
